1
00:00:02,294 --> 00:00:04,880
-[ASTA] That was amazing!
-[MAGNA] Huh?

2
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:06,548
Asta, look.

3
00:00:06,632 --> 00:00:08,759
-[wind howling]
-[exhales]

4
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:10,761
[chuckles softly]

5
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:14,514
Captain Yami and I barely
managed to beat this guy,

6
00:00:14,598 --> 00:00:16,225
and that was with the two of us.

7
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:18,268
But you did it alone.

8
00:00:18,352 --> 00:00:19,728
You're awesome, Magna!

9
00:00:19,811 --> 00:00:21,396
You're damn straight I am.

10
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,564
You're not bad yourself,

11
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:24,358
but I'm still your superior.

12
00:00:24,441 --> 00:00:25,859
-[coughs]
-[ASTA] Seriously, though,

13
00:00:25,943 --> 00:00:27,152
the way he just
dropped to the ground?

14
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:28,654
-It was the coolest thing ever!
-[LUCK] Magna.

15
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:29,738
Man-- Huh?

16
00:00:30,197 --> 00:00:31,365
That was great!

17
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:33,450
I'm totally pumped
for our next match.

18
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:34,952
Oh, yeah?

19
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:37,704
Well, I'll be kicking your ass,
no question.

20
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:41,875
[JACK] I'm a commoner,

21
00:00:41,959 --> 00:00:43,210
but I was strong enough

22
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:45,379
to work my way up the ranks
to captain.

23
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:48,048
I won't let any noble
or royal beat me.

24
00:00:48,131 --> 00:00:49,007
[huffs]

25
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:52,636
I sought out other commoners
to add to my squad.

26
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:54,513
When Yami went
and let that peasant

27
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:56,223
into the Black Bulls, though,

28
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:58,559
I thought he was completely
out of his mind.

29
00:00:59,101 --> 00:01:00,644
I'll be damned.

30
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:01,812
Keh, keh.

31
00:01:01,895 --> 00:01:03,981
I won't be forgetting this
any time soon.

32
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:07,985
[NACHT]
With his devil power at 100%,

33
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:09,653
Dante would have rivaled
the strength

34
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:11,238
of a supreme devil.

35
00:01:12,155 --> 00:01:14,116
-Yet this mage defeated him.
-[speaking indistinctly]

36
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,200
[quivering]

37
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:16,243
[NACHT]
I don't know how he did it.

38
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:18,537
I'm just glad he did.

39
00:01:20,289 --> 00:01:21,957
We're far from done, though.

40
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,379
-[low growling]
-[wings flapping]

41
00:01:29,381 --> 00:01:31,758
It's like a never-ending
parade of evil.

42
00:01:32,968 --> 00:01:34,511
What a lovely sight!

43
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:36,096
[grunts]

44
00:01:37,597 --> 00:01:39,600
♪

45
00:01:47,608 --> 00:01:49,860
So Dante has fallen, huh?

46
00:01:50,902 --> 00:01:52,738
I'd love to know
what sort of magic they used

47
00:01:52,821 --> 00:01:53,864
to take him out.

48
00:01:55,115 --> 00:01:57,117
[NACHT] Qliphoth will surely
be less efficient

49
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,869
with one member
of the Triad down.

50
00:01:59,494 --> 00:02:01,371
But if we're going to
stop it entirely,

51
00:02:02,164 --> 00:02:04,374
we still need to defeat
the remaining two.

52
00:02:05,792 --> 00:02:06,793
There aren't many left,

53
00:02:07,127 --> 00:02:08,920
and I'm not sure
how much they'll restore you,

54
00:02:09,004 --> 00:02:10,964
but these magic snacks
should help.

55
00:02:11,048 --> 00:02:11,965
Eat up.

56
00:02:12,049 --> 00:02:13,258
-Yeah!
-Thank you, sir!

57
00:02:13,342 --> 00:02:15,677
Now I'm ready
to go rescue Captain Yami!

58
00:02:15,761 --> 00:02:16,720
No, I'm doing it!

59
00:02:16,803 --> 00:02:18,055
Not if I get there first!

60
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:20,599
The magic around the Triad
is too strong,

61
00:02:20,682 --> 00:02:22,559
so I can't take us there
through the shadows.

62
00:02:22,643 --> 00:02:24,269
-Let's hurry.
-[ALL] Right!

63
00:02:24,353 --> 00:02:26,355
[footsteps receding]

64
00:02:26,438 --> 00:02:28,065
[wind howling]

65
00:02:29,107 --> 00:02:30,192
[Dante groans]

66
00:02:33,236 --> 00:02:35,072
[growling]

67
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:37,157
♪

68
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:42,829
[groaning]

69
00:02:43,622 --> 00:02:44,956
Me, lose to him?

70
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,125
To some
insignificant little peon?!

71
00:02:47,209 --> 00:02:49,461
That would never happen!

72
00:02:49,544 --> 00:02:51,338
[JACK]
Guess the almighty Dark Triad

73
00:02:51,421 --> 00:02:53,256
deserves its reputation.

74
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:57,386
That rapid regeneration of yours
makes you a tough one to kill.

75
00:02:57,469 --> 00:02:58,470
Keh, keh.

76
00:02:59,137 --> 00:03:00,639
But you're less of a threat

77
00:03:00,722 --> 00:03:03,809
now that you've lost control
of your precious body magic!

78
00:03:03,892 --> 00:03:07,062
Not a threat?
I'll kill every last one of you!

79
00:03:07,145 --> 00:03:09,523
I'll show you what happens
when you defy someone

80
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:10,690
like me!

81
00:03:10,774 --> 00:03:11,900
I'm immortal,

82
00:03:11,983 --> 00:03:13,235
-and you're all just insects!
-For once,

83
00:03:13,318 --> 00:03:14,736
will you shut your damn trap?

84
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:16,738
-[growling]
-I'm all for stubbornness,

85
00:03:16,822 --> 00:03:18,490
but one of us insects beat you,

86
00:03:18,573 --> 00:03:21,493
and you're not going
to take that away from him!

87
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:30,877
♪

88
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,047
[grunts]

89
00:03:37,050 --> 00:03:38,176
[chuckles]

90
00:03:38,927 --> 00:03:40,846
[CHARLOTTE] I can limit
her curse-warding magic,

91
00:03:40,929 --> 00:03:43,098
but her blood magic
is strong on its own.

92
00:03:43,181 --> 00:03:44,641
What's worse...

93
00:03:44,725 --> 00:03:46,017
Those two are pretty good,

94
00:03:46,101 --> 00:03:48,186
but I think
we make the better team.

95
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:51,773
You agree, Loropechika, right?

96
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:53,900
Just look at you.

97
00:03:53,984 --> 00:03:55,610
I knew you would be
something special

98
00:03:55,694 --> 00:03:57,154
once you finally let loose.

99
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:58,488
And doesn't it feel nice

100
00:03:58,572 --> 00:04:01,241
to unleash your full
destructive power like this?

101
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:03,785
Loropechika! Picture Magic:

102
00:04:03,869 --> 00:04:05,495
Subterranean Giants!

103
00:04:05,579 --> 00:04:06,538
[roaring]

104
00:04:06,830 --> 00:04:09,332
Stop that pesky spell for me,
will you?

105
00:04:13,795 --> 00:04:15,297
[grunts]

106
00:04:19,384 --> 00:04:20,886
[Rill screams]

107
00:04:23,346 --> 00:04:25,474
Her magic
was already incredible,

108
00:04:25,557 --> 00:04:28,268
but the curse
is making it even stronger!

109
00:04:28,894 --> 00:04:30,520
[Charlotte grunts] Huh!

110
00:04:31,062 --> 00:04:32,230
I'm so sorry.

111
00:04:32,856 --> 00:04:34,149
I know how awful it is

112
00:04:34,232 --> 00:04:36,359
to have control
of your body stolen.

113
00:04:37,777 --> 00:04:40,530
But I swear, we'll free you!

114
00:04:40,614 --> 00:04:41,490
[grunts]

115
00:04:42,574 --> 00:04:43,950
[effort grunts]

116
00:04:44,034 --> 00:04:45,952
[cackles obnoxiously]

117
00:04:46,036 --> 00:04:47,996
Why are you people
always so uptight

118
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,664
when it comes to fighting?

119
00:04:49,748 --> 00:04:51,166
One of these days,

120
00:04:51,249 --> 00:04:53,168
it's gonna get you killed!

121
00:04:53,251 --> 00:04:54,586
Charlotte, look out!

122
00:04:54,669 --> 00:04:55,754
[Charlotte grunts]

123
00:05:03,595 --> 00:05:05,347
I'm here for our rematch,
Vanica,

124
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:07,641
-as promised!
-[cackles maniacally]

125
00:05:07,724 --> 00:05:09,142
Queen Loropechika!

126
00:05:09,226 --> 00:05:10,852
[VANICA] Hey, Noelle.

127
00:05:10,936 --> 00:05:12,896
You got stronger
like I said to, right?

128
00:05:12,979 --> 00:05:15,941
'Cause this isn't going to be
very fun otherwise.

129
00:05:16,024 --> 00:05:17,734
I'd hate to be disappointed.

130
00:05:19,861 --> 00:05:21,655
How dare you harm Loropechika.

131
00:05:22,405 --> 00:05:24,241
Yes, I've gotten stronger.

132
00:05:25,033 --> 00:05:26,117
-[giggles]
-What's more...

133
00:05:27,619 --> 00:05:28,787
...I'm not alone!

134
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,914
And together,
we're going to make you pay!

135
00:05:31,581 --> 00:05:33,458
[chuckles] I knew it.

136
00:05:34,292 --> 00:05:35,544
[Charlotte gasps]

137
00:05:35,836 --> 00:05:38,547
But I thought Undine
was serving Queen Loropechika.

138
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:39,881
[wind howling]

139
00:05:39,965 --> 00:05:41,049
[DRYAD] Listen, Noelle.

140
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:45,303
Ultimate Magic's important,
and we'll get to that,

141
00:05:45,387 --> 00:05:48,390
but there's something else
I want you to focus on first.

142
00:05:48,473 --> 00:05:49,724
Something like what?

143
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:51,226
Uh?

144
00:05:51,935 --> 00:05:53,728
-All right, your turn.
-[Noelle grunts]

145
00:05:54,396 --> 00:05:55,772
-[water gushing]
-Huh?

146
00:05:57,482 --> 00:05:58,650
Undine?

147
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:00,318
I-I don't understand.

148
00:06:00,402 --> 00:06:01,528
How are you here?

149
00:06:02,028 --> 00:06:02,904
[sighs softly]

150
00:06:04,155 --> 00:06:06,866
The curse-warding magic
drained me of my power,

151
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:10,453
and my contract with Loropechika
was temporarily dissolved.

152
00:06:11,329 --> 00:06:12,664
So in order to regain
my strength

153
00:06:12,747 --> 00:06:13,999
and store up mana,

154
00:06:14,624 --> 00:06:17,586
I transferred to the grimoire
of another qualified mage.

155
00:06:18,878 --> 00:06:20,714
That mage was you.

156
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:21,673
[gasps]

157
00:06:21,756 --> 00:06:23,258
You have what it takes

158
00:06:23,341 --> 00:06:25,510
to become a host
for the water spirit.

159
00:06:25,594 --> 00:06:27,012
[DRYAD] Using half her body,

160
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:30,765
Vanica has manifested
the supreme devil Megicula.

161
00:06:30,849 --> 00:06:32,475
There's a way to finish her off

162
00:06:32,559 --> 00:06:35,478
besides sending
arcane stage mages against her.

163
00:06:36,146 --> 00:06:38,398
It's something that
only spirit hosts can attain.

164
00:06:39,024 --> 00:06:42,152
Something that can purify malice
and destroy devils.

165
00:06:42,652 --> 00:06:43,987
The saint stage.

166
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,113
Undine?

167
00:06:45,572 --> 00:06:46,489
Anything to add?

168
00:06:48,116 --> 00:06:49,743
But if that's the case,

169
00:06:49,826 --> 00:06:52,871
why rely on Asta
and the other arcane stage mages

170
00:06:52,954 --> 00:06:56,750
instead of training spirit hosts
like Captain Fuegoleon and Yuno?

171
00:06:56,833 --> 00:06:59,002
In fact,
if anyone was going to do it,

172
00:06:59,085 --> 00:07:00,879
shouldn't it have been
Loropechika,

173
00:07:00,962 --> 00:07:02,714
given how powerful she is?

174
00:07:04,132 --> 00:07:05,675
Let me tell you a story.

175
00:07:07,052 --> 00:07:10,305
Long ago, I befriended the first
queen of the Heart Kingdom

176
00:07:10,388 --> 00:07:12,265
and decided to make her my host.

177
00:07:12,891 --> 00:07:14,643
I grew to love
the kingdom's people

178
00:07:14,726 --> 00:07:16,561
and, alongside their queens,

179
00:07:16,645 --> 00:07:18,480
protected them
for generations after.

180
00:07:19,356 --> 00:07:21,566
Many years came and went,
but eventually,

181
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,443
-I met Loropechika.
-Hmm?

182
00:07:23,526 --> 00:07:25,070
[exclaims] Mm.

183
00:07:25,695 --> 00:07:27,238
It was clear from a young age

184
00:07:27,322 --> 00:07:29,115
that she had
immense magic power...

185
00:07:29,199 --> 00:07:30,492
-[chuckles]
-...more than enough

186
00:07:30,575 --> 00:07:32,869
to qualify her
to become the next queen.

187
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:35,955
But something else set her apart

188
00:07:36,039 --> 00:07:37,916
from the rulers
who had come before.

189
00:07:38,667 --> 00:07:42,837
You see, Loropechika was unable
to learn a single attack spell.

190
00:07:43,421 --> 00:07:45,965
The most she could do
was create simulacra

191
00:07:46,049 --> 00:07:48,760
and use spells
that looked like attacks.

192
00:07:48,843 --> 00:07:51,054
She'd never be
able to attain saint stage

193
00:07:51,137 --> 00:07:53,807
and acquire the power
to destroy devils.

194
00:07:53,890 --> 00:07:56,935
-[chuckles]
-That girl is just far too kind.

195
00:07:58,978 --> 00:08:00,397
[Loropechika chuckles awkwardly]

196
00:08:01,022 --> 00:08:03,775
So weak that I can't even
learn one attack spell.

197
00:08:03,858 --> 00:08:06,695
-I'm not fit to be queen, am I?
-[sighs]

198
00:08:08,405 --> 00:08:11,157
That's not true,
so don't even think it.

199
00:08:11,908 --> 00:08:13,618
Your kindness is your strength,

200
00:08:13,702 --> 00:08:15,286
and I couldn't be prouder.

201
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:18,498
Really, Undine?
Do you mean that?

202
00:08:20,041 --> 00:08:22,210
[UNDINE] So I kept quiet
about the saint stage,

203
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:25,046
though I knew
I was being selfish.

204
00:08:27,173 --> 00:08:30,051
Even when devil hosts
appeared in the Spade Kingdom,

205
00:08:30,135 --> 00:08:32,846
even when Vanica
came after Loropechika...

206
00:08:33,513 --> 00:08:34,931
I still said nothing,

207
00:08:35,014 --> 00:08:37,767
hoping I could keep her away
from the fighting somehow.

208
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:41,938
I wanted her to remain herself,

209
00:08:42,605 --> 00:08:43,732
my kind girl.

210
00:08:45,108 --> 00:08:46,109
Oh, you poor thing.

211
00:08:46,735 --> 00:08:47,902
[grunts softly]

212
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:51,156
[UNDINE] But in the end,
Loropechika was cursed,

213
00:08:51,239 --> 00:08:52,449
and then kidnapped.

214
00:08:53,074 --> 00:08:54,576
[sobs]

215
00:08:54,659 --> 00:08:57,704
She trusted me,
and I made the wrong choice.

216
00:08:58,872 --> 00:08:59,873
[NOELLE] Maybe so.

217
00:09:00,707 --> 00:09:03,501
You didn't tell her
about what saint stage could do.

218
00:09:03,585 --> 00:09:06,045
Things might have been different
if you had,

219
00:09:06,129 --> 00:09:09,007
but you kept it from her
out of kindness, didn't you?

220
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:10,091
[gasps]

221
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:13,470
Being kind and wanting the best
for those you love?

222
00:09:13,553 --> 00:09:15,180
That's always the right choice
to make!

223
00:09:15,263 --> 00:09:16,514
Always!

224
00:09:16,598 --> 00:09:17,599
You think so?

225
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:19,559
[NOELLE] Sure, we argue,

226
00:09:19,642 --> 00:09:21,311
and maybe
we'll never be friends,

227
00:09:21,394 --> 00:09:23,396
but you and I
do have the same goal.

228
00:09:25,774 --> 00:09:28,777
I mean to defeat Vanica
and save Loropechika,

229
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:30,653
and I want you to join me.

230
00:09:32,947 --> 00:09:34,032
[seething]

231
00:09:34,783 --> 00:09:36,409
I'm just trying to prove to her

232
00:09:36,493 --> 00:09:39,078
how good it can feel
to loosen up once in a while.

233
00:09:39,162 --> 00:09:40,997
She's having so much fun.

234
00:09:41,456 --> 00:09:42,373
Can't you tell?

235
00:09:42,457 --> 00:09:44,250
She's a whole new woman.

236
00:09:44,334 --> 00:09:46,586
Go on, Loropechika, show them!

237
00:09:47,545 --> 00:09:48,922
-Don't just defend.
-[grunting]

238
00:09:49,005 --> 00:09:50,590
[VANICA]
You need to attack, too.

239
00:09:50,673 --> 00:09:53,760
That way, you can
enjoy the fight together.

240
00:09:54,427 --> 00:09:56,721
-The more, the merrier!
-[continues grunting]

241
00:09:59,098 --> 00:10:01,476
Enough.
I'm done listening to you.

242
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:03,269
Ooh, goodie!

243
00:10:03,353 --> 00:10:06,022
Does that mean
it's time for us to play?

244
00:10:06,106 --> 00:10:07,565
You brought us here.

245
00:10:08,316 --> 00:10:09,484
To this point.

246
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:13,446
This is your fault!

247
00:10:15,782 --> 00:10:19,327
I'm expecting a nice,
lengthy battle, understand?

248
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:20,745
Make it worth my while.

249
00:10:20,829 --> 00:10:23,206
I've waited for so long.

250
00:10:23,289 --> 00:10:25,667
-Vanica, would you shut up?
-[grunts]

251
00:10:27,418 --> 00:10:29,337
You think you can do
whatever you want,

252
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:31,089
regardless of the cost.

253
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:32,924
You stand there
laughing like an idiot

254
00:10:33,007 --> 00:10:34,175
while good people are crying.

255
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:36,177
[electricity crackling]

256
00:10:37,262 --> 00:10:38,513
No more!

257
00:10:38,596 --> 00:10:39,931
It ends now!

258
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:53,695
Spirit Dive.

259
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,620
Saint Valkyrie Armor!

260
00:11:02,704 --> 00:11:03,955
[grunts]

261
00:11:04,038 --> 00:11:07,041
[NOELLE]
I am going to destroy you!

262
00:11:11,254 --> 00:11:12,255
[Vanica gasps]

263
00:11:13,256 --> 00:11:15,049
I've felt this chill before.

264
00:11:15,133 --> 00:11:16,175
Blood Magic:

265
00:11:16,259 --> 00:11:18,636
- Herd of Red Beasts.
-[snarling]

266
00:11:26,102 --> 00:11:28,021
[VANICA] She eliminated
the beasts easily.

267
00:11:28,771 --> 00:11:30,690
In both appearance and power,

268
00:11:30,773 --> 00:11:32,150
she's completely different

269
00:11:32,233 --> 00:11:33,401
from when we were
in the Heart Kingdom.

270
00:11:34,903 --> 00:11:36,738
[exclaiming excitedly]

271
00:11:36,821 --> 00:11:38,156
Perfect!

272
00:11:38,239 --> 00:11:40,658
I knew
you were worth waiting for!

273
00:11:40,742 --> 00:11:41,701
[Charlotte gasps]

274
00:11:41,784 --> 00:11:42,785
I know your blue roses

275
00:11:43,119 --> 00:11:45,079
are weakening
Vanica's curse-warding magic,

276
00:11:45,163 --> 00:11:46,039
but even so,

277
00:11:46,122 --> 00:11:47,665
Noelle's incredible!

278
00:11:47,749 --> 00:11:49,834
We mustn't spend too long here.

279
00:11:49,918 --> 00:11:52,170
A minute.
That's all we can spare, Noelle.

280
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:55,214
[NOELLE] No problem.
I'll end this in 30 seconds!

281
00:11:55,298 --> 00:11:56,215
♪

282
00:11:56,299 --> 00:11:57,425
[chuckles]

283
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:03,056
[cackles]

284
00:12:03,139 --> 00:12:04,557
[crunching]

285
00:12:04,641 --> 00:12:06,100
[squealing]

286
00:12:06,851 --> 00:12:07,936
[yells]

287
00:12:08,561 --> 00:12:10,438
[cackles maniacally]

288
00:12:10,897 --> 00:12:12,982
Ooh, so good!

289
00:12:13,066 --> 00:12:15,276
This is the most fun
I’ve had in ages!

290
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,736
Well done!

291
00:12:17,403 --> 00:12:18,529
Yes,

292
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:21,324
someone else once
made me shiver like this.

293
00:12:22,033 --> 00:12:25,078
It was right after
I became Megicula's host.

294
00:12:25,161 --> 00:12:26,913
I wanted to try out
the devil's powers

295
00:12:26,996 --> 00:12:28,581
and really go wild.

296
00:12:29,249 --> 00:12:31,751
I heard there was a woman
tucked away in Clover somewhere

297
00:12:31,834 --> 00:12:34,629
who was supposed to be
the strongest fighter around.

298
00:12:34,712 --> 00:12:36,881
So, I snuck out
of the Spade Kingdom

299
00:12:36,965 --> 00:12:38,341
-to go play with her.
-[panting]

300
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:40,343
[VANICA] I thought
this was going to be fun,

301
00:12:40,426 --> 00:12:42,011
and it looks like I was right.

302
00:12:42,095 --> 00:12:44,263
I hope you can amuse me
a bit longer,

303
00:12:44,347 --> 00:12:46,474
Acier, my sweet!

304
00:12:46,557 --> 00:12:47,767
[panting]

305
00:12:47,850 --> 00:12:49,936
-Get ready! Huh?
-[baby crying]

306
00:12:50,019 --> 00:12:51,062
[gasps]

307
00:12:51,145 --> 00:12:52,855
-[baby continues crying]
-Huh?

308
00:12:54,983 --> 00:12:56,693
Noelle! Nozel!

309
00:12:56,776 --> 00:12:59,946
I don't need some crying brat
crashing my playtime.

310
00:13:00,029 --> 00:13:02,198
-[continues crying]
-Maybe I'll kill it first

311
00:13:02,282 --> 00:13:03,366
to shut it up.

312
00:13:04,033 --> 00:13:06,494
I'm guessing
these are your kids, Acier.

313
00:13:06,577 --> 00:13:08,746
What did you wanna go
and have babies for?

314
00:13:09,414 --> 00:13:10,581
I don't see the point.

315
00:13:10,665 --> 00:13:12,291
They just wear you out
and get in the way.

316
00:13:12,375 --> 00:13:14,460
-[panting]
-You'd be stronger without them.

317
00:13:15,503 --> 00:13:17,797
[grunts] The strongest person
in the world

318
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,674
isn't the one
with the most power.

319
00:13:19,757 --> 00:13:20,842
[gasps]

320
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:22,051
-It's a mother...
-[continues crying]

321
00:13:22,135 --> 00:13:23,553
...protecting her kids!

322
00:13:24,178 --> 00:13:25,263
Huh?

323
00:13:25,346 --> 00:13:26,264
[groans]

324
00:13:29,308 --> 00:13:31,185
[chuckles excitedly]

325
00:13:31,269 --> 00:13:34,188
-Curse-Warding Magic!
-[gasps]

326
00:13:37,275 --> 00:13:39,068
[Nozel whimpers]

327
00:13:39,736 --> 00:13:42,280
[VANICA] I was mortally wounded
after our fight.

328
00:13:42,989 --> 00:13:45,241
Megicula told me to run,
so I did.

329
00:13:46,659 --> 00:13:47,577
I remember.

330
00:13:48,619 --> 00:13:51,914
And now, here we are again!

331
00:13:51,998 --> 00:13:53,041
Blood Magic:

332
00:13:53,124 --> 00:13:55,043
Red Beast!

333
00:13:55,126 --> 00:13:57,295
Let's pick up where we left off.

334
00:13:58,129 --> 00:13:59,839
[NOELLE] Sea Dragon's Roar!

335
00:14:05,928 --> 00:14:06,971
[Vanica gasps]

336
00:14:08,056 --> 00:14:10,391
You've hurt so many people,
but now...

337
00:14:11,434 --> 00:14:13,186
...it's your turn!

338
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,022
[spurts]

339
00:14:17,482 --> 00:14:19,233
-[cackles]
-[gasps]

340
00:14:19,859 --> 00:14:22,195
[cackles maniacally]

341
00:14:22,278 --> 00:14:24,489
That was a seriously cool move!

342
00:14:24,572 --> 00:14:26,282
You're the best, Noelle!

343
00:14:26,365 --> 00:14:28,242
♪

344
00:14:40,171 --> 00:14:41,464
[chuckles]

345
00:14:43,966 --> 00:14:45,176
[grunts]

346
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:49,138
[metal clanking]

347
00:14:51,224 --> 00:14:52,517
[grunts]

348
00:14:55,812 --> 00:14:57,438
[giggles]

349
00:15:01,359 --> 00:15:02,735
[squeals]

350
00:15:04,737 --> 00:15:06,739
[loud crash]

351
00:15:16,207 --> 00:15:17,625
[grunts]

352
00:15:17,708 --> 00:15:19,585
[metal clanking]

353
00:15:19,669 --> 00:15:20,753
[effort grunts]

354
00:15:26,426 --> 00:15:27,510
[yells]

355
00:15:29,512 --> 00:15:30,721
[gasps]

356
00:15:36,936 --> 00:15:37,937
[gasps]

357
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,819
[beasts snarling]

358
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:48,865
[beasts snarling]

359
00:15:50,616 --> 00:15:51,701
[grins]

360
00:15:53,077 --> 00:15:54,620
♪

361
00:16:05,089 --> 00:16:06,966
We're not done yet!

362
00:16:11,846 --> 00:16:13,598
[squealing] Yes!

363
00:16:13,681 --> 00:16:15,474
You're on a roll! Keep going!

364
00:16:15,558 --> 00:16:18,060
That's it! Give me more!

365
00:16:21,105 --> 00:16:24,692
[laughs maniacally]

366
00:16:27,069 --> 00:16:29,197
You really are the best,
you know.

367
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:31,490
My darling Noelle!

368
00:16:32,491 --> 00:16:33,492
[Noelle grunts]

369
00:16:37,371 --> 00:16:38,289
[gasps]

370
00:16:54,180 --> 00:16:56,349
-[loud crash]
-[rumbling]

371
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:58,434
[wind howling]

372
00:16:59,477 --> 00:17:02,688
You lose, Vanica. It's over!

373
00:17:03,272 --> 00:17:05,149
[Vanica wheezing]

374
00:17:07,068 --> 00:17:08,236
That was...

375
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:09,987
so amazing.

376
00:17:10,071 --> 00:17:11,322
-[wind howling]
-[exclaims]

377
00:17:11,656 --> 00:17:15,326
[VANICA] I'm experiencing
emotions I've never had before.

378
00:17:15,993 --> 00:17:17,912
Is this
what friendship feels like?

379
00:17:17,995 --> 00:17:19,288
You caught up to me,

380
00:17:19,372 --> 00:17:21,540
and now I have to
catch up to you.

381
00:17:21,624 --> 00:17:23,125
So we're friends and rivals.

382
00:17:23,209 --> 00:17:24,585
We can keep competing

383
00:17:24,669 --> 00:17:26,045
to see which of us
is the strongest.

384
00:17:26,128 --> 00:17:27,338
I want nothing more
to do with you.

385
00:17:27,421 --> 00:17:28,631
[VANICA] Huh?

386
00:17:29,507 --> 00:17:31,092
[NOELLE] Did you really think
this was settled

387
00:17:31,175 --> 00:17:33,344
just because you found
what you were looking for?

388
00:17:34,971 --> 00:17:37,890
I'm putting an end
to your cruelty, for good!

389
00:17:37,974 --> 00:17:39,684
-[DEVIL] I knew it.
-Huh?

390
00:17:39,767 --> 00:17:43,479
You've been a truly
entertaining host, Vanica.

391
00:17:43,563 --> 00:17:44,730
-[quivering]
-But I'm afraid

392
00:17:44,814 --> 00:17:46,857
this simply won't do.

393
00:17:50,403 --> 00:17:51,320
[NOELLE] This magic...

394
00:17:52,572 --> 00:17:55,825
[DEVIl] Lucifero and the others
haven't noticed us.

395
00:17:55,908 --> 00:17:59,120
And there are the souls
of three vastly powerful mages

396
00:17:59,203 --> 00:18:00,413
of the same sex here.

397
00:18:00,871 --> 00:18:02,164
It is time.

398
00:18:03,416 --> 00:18:07,253
The preparations for my descent
are finally in place.

399
00:18:07,336 --> 00:18:08,212
[Vanica exclaims]

400
00:18:09,755 --> 00:18:11,757
[CHARLOTTE]
The power of this curse.

401
00:18:11,841 --> 00:18:13,092
Impossible!

402
00:18:13,759 --> 00:18:16,595
But there's no doubting it.
That's...

403
00:18:20,808 --> 00:18:23,060
...Megicula in the flesh!

404
00:18:23,477 --> 00:18:24,854
[exclaims]

405
00:18:24,937 --> 00:18:26,605
[MEGICULA] I've been
with Vanica a long time,

406
00:18:26,689 --> 00:18:28,899
so I don't
make this decision lightly.

407
00:18:29,567 --> 00:18:32,236
But if she and Loropechika die,

408
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:35,114
my manifestation
will be complete.

409
00:18:35,197 --> 00:18:36,866
Queen Loropechika-- [grunts]

410
00:18:41,329 --> 00:18:43,664
I'll let you have
one last brawl, though.

411
00:18:45,041 --> 00:18:47,585
If you die together,
it won't be so lonely.

412
00:18:48,377 --> 00:18:49,837
Isn't that right,

413
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,088
humans?

414
00:18:51,172 --> 00:18:53,299
You're here? But how?

415
00:18:53,382 --> 00:18:54,800
It doesn't make sense.

416
00:18:54,884 --> 00:18:57,970
Only one of the gates
to the underworld is open.

417
00:18:58,054 --> 00:18:59,889
[MEGICULA]
The gates are just insurance.

418
00:18:59,972 --> 00:19:03,142
My true goal is to manifest
through the curse-warding spell,

419
00:19:03,225 --> 00:19:05,353
Malevolent Femcantation.

420
00:19:05,436 --> 00:19:09,440
It requires some sacrifices
and a great deal of preparation,

421
00:19:09,523 --> 00:19:11,567
so it's quite difficult
to pull off.

422
00:19:12,318 --> 00:19:13,736
First, there was the royal,

423
00:19:13,819 --> 00:19:16,572
Acier Silva
from the Clover Kingdom.

424
00:19:16,656 --> 00:19:18,991
Cursing her to death
allowed me to half-manifest

425
00:19:19,075 --> 00:19:20,618
in Vanica's body.

426
00:19:20,701 --> 00:19:21,911
[grunts angrily]

427
00:19:21,994 --> 00:19:23,371
Mother.

428
00:19:24,038 --> 00:19:26,749
[MEGICULA] Then there's Vanica
herself, the gifted devil host

429
00:19:26,832 --> 00:19:28,209
with whom I made a contract.

430
00:19:28,292 --> 00:19:29,710
Because she is near death,

431
00:19:29,794 --> 00:19:32,880
I was able to emerge somewhat,
though not completely.

432
00:19:34,131 --> 00:19:37,635
Finally, there's Loropechika,
the queen of the Heart Kingdom

433
00:19:37,718 --> 00:19:39,512
and a mage of immense power.

434
00:19:39,595 --> 00:19:41,097
When she and Vanica die,

435
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:43,474
I will fully manifest
in this world at last.

436
00:19:45,935 --> 00:19:49,480
[LOROPECHIKA] Devil Water Magic:
Hydra of Darkneros.

437
00:19:49,563 --> 00:19:51,524
Such malicious magic.

438
00:19:52,191 --> 00:19:53,692
What did you do to Loropechika?

439
00:19:53,776 --> 00:19:55,903
I tinkered
with the curse on her a bit.

440
00:19:55,986 --> 00:19:58,447
She'll spend her last moments
of life as a devil.

441
00:19:58,531 --> 00:20:00,991
I thought I'd give her
the chance to have a little fun

442
00:20:01,075 --> 00:20:02,535
-before she died.
-[grunts angrily]

443
00:20:02,618 --> 00:20:04,495
That's not your choice to make!

444
00:20:05,246 --> 00:20:06,956
I'll defeat you and restore her!

445
00:20:10,626 --> 00:20:11,710
[grunts in disbelief]

446
00:20:11,794 --> 00:20:13,003
It vanished.

447
00:20:13,713 --> 00:20:16,215
Curse-Warding Magic:
Decaying World.

448
00:20:16,298 --> 00:20:17,967
The speed and power
of the spell's effects

449
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:19,593
are exponentially greater

450
00:20:19,677 --> 00:20:21,762
when I'm partially manifested
like this.

451
00:20:24,181 --> 00:20:25,266
[grunts]

452
00:20:25,933 --> 00:20:28,769
I won't let you gain more
of a foothold in this world

453
00:20:28,853 --> 00:20:31,105
You have the distinction
of being the first one

454
00:20:31,188 --> 00:20:32,815
to ever oppose my curse.

455
00:20:32,898 --> 00:20:34,984
-[grunts]
-A splendid performance,

456
00:20:35,067 --> 00:20:37,403
-Queen of Briars.
-[RILL] Hmph.

457
00:20:38,028 --> 00:20:40,448
I'll do whatever it takes
to protect Charlotte.

458
00:20:40,531 --> 00:20:43,909
Curse-Warding Magic:
Unbound Slave.

459
00:20:45,035 --> 00:20:47,288
[RILL] Noelle's beautiful spell
will be the inspiration

460
00:20:47,371 --> 00:20:48,497
for one of my own!

461
00:20:50,541 --> 00:20:51,834
Picture Magic:

462
00:20:53,502 --> 00:20:54,920
Twilight Valhalla!

463
00:21:04,972 --> 00:21:06,599
[GAJA] True Lightning Magic:

464
00:21:06,682 --> 00:21:08,434
Nadaras do Astrauza!

465
00:21:13,355 --> 00:21:14,356
[grunts]

466
00:21:15,316 --> 00:21:16,567
[chuckles awkwardly]

467
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:19,653
I'm so weak I can't learn
even one attack spell.

468
00:21:19,737 --> 00:21:21,989
I'm not fit to be queen, am I?

469
00:21:22,740 --> 00:21:24,742
♪

470
00:21:26,660 --> 00:21:29,205
[GAJA] That day,
I decided I would become

471
00:21:29,288 --> 00:21:32,082
the strongest defensive mage
in the Heart Kingdom.

472
00:21:33,459 --> 00:21:36,086
I swore
if any enemies came against us,

473
00:21:36,754 --> 00:21:38,297
I would destroy them...

474
00:21:39,006 --> 00:21:40,508
-in your place!
-[inaudible dialogue]

475
00:21:42,259 --> 00:21:43,761
[chuckles]

476
00:21:45,554 --> 00:21:47,348
[GAJA] It's all for you.

477
00:21:49,266 --> 00:21:50,142
[flesh squelching]

478
00:21:53,187 --> 00:21:54,188
[grunts]

479
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:01,111
Gaja!

480
00:22:03,364 --> 00:22:04,365
[grunts]

481
00:22:05,699 --> 00:22:06,617
[gasps]

482
00:22:08,869 --> 00:22:11,789
My Spirit Dive came undone.

483
00:22:12,998 --> 00:22:14,792
The battle is over.

484
00:22:18,003 --> 00:22:19,171
You lose.

485
00:22:20,464 --> 00:22:22,424
[♪ closing theme song playing]

